Goal includes dispatched shift_candidate_alpha, origin_availability_alpha, destination_availability_alpha. Also candidate_staged_for_loading shift_candidate_beta, candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_beta driver_operator_alpha, candidate_skill_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta skill_certificate_alpha, compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha (already true initially? Actually compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha is in init, so already true. So we just need to ensure it remains true (no action that removes it). There's no action that removes compliance_certificate_available except release_compliance_certificate which would remove it. So we must avoid releasing it.

